sequenceDiagram
    participant FE
    participant API as everfit-api
    participant DB as MongoDB

    FE->>API: GET get-list-trainer-default-body-metric
    API-->>FE: full catalog, trainer's default metrics marked selected

    opt Manage Metric, create a metric not in the catalog
        FE->>API: POST add-new-metric
        API-->>FE: new metric
    end

    FE->>API: PATCH task-libraries by id, with metrics
    API->>DB: TaskLibrary updateOne, set metrics
    Note over DB: tasks already assigned from this Library keep their own saved metrics

    Note over FE,API: later, assigning to a client
    FE->>API: POST add-task-from-library
    API->>DB: read Library doc, metrics already on it
    API->>DB: Task.create, new independent task
